From: mpv-ht development <mpv-ht@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] wasapi: duplicate bitstream to two synchronized endpoints

Opt-in same-track dual WASAPI transport, exact format negotiation, bounded
byte-preserving queues, coordinated pause/reset, clock monitoring and drift
holds, and EOF draining on both devices. Off by default.

